# Leads — {{PROJECT}}

> This file is yours (project-owned). It is the **pipeline board** — one entry
> per lead (a sales opportunity). `/lead` captures and advances entries;
> `/qualify` advances a lead through the qualification bar. Read
> `.claude/crm-rules.md` for the record + lifecycle; `.claude/crm-gate.md` for
> this business's stages, qualification bar, and lead-source taxonomy.

**Lifecycle:** `new → contacted → qualified → proposal → won | lost`. When a
lead reaches **won**, flip its account `status → active` in
`crm/ACCOUNTS.md` (a won lead is a new current customer). `won` and `lost` are
terminal and **stay in the ledger** — a lost lead is memory; never delete it.
Ids are `LEAD-NNN`, monotonic. Dates absolute.

**Legend** — `LEAD-NNN` (lead id) · `account: @acct-<slug>` (join to the
account hub) · `contact: CON-NNN` (join to a contact) · `source` + `stage`
from the gate · `value` an estimate · each `next_action` = the single next
step + its date. Grouped by stage.

